@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
hide footbox
participant "m:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "book:AddressBook" as Book MODEL_COLOR
participant "filteredPersons:FilteredList" as Filtered MODEL_COLOR

note over Model, Book : Precondition: a roster is selected; the ride-list listener already exists.
[-> Model : setRide(ride, replacement)
activate Model
Model -> Book : setRide(ride, replacement)
activate Book
Book -> Model : <<notification>> ride-list listener
activate Model
Model -> Model : refreshRideListFilter()
Model -> Book : getRideList()
Book --> Model : latest rides
Model -> Filtered : setPredicate(roster phone membership)
note right of Filtered : Existing SortedList and cyclist panel\nobserve the updated filtered list.
Model --> Book : callback returns
deactivate Model
Book --> Model
deactivate Book
[<-- Model
deactivate Model

legend bottom
  Incoming call: a successful roster command (parsing and saving omitted).
  Notification abstracts synchronous JavaFX listener dispatch, not a book method call.
  The selected persistent ID is retained; no new ridelist command or listener is needed.
endlegend
@enduml
